# mmn-tx-explorer Monorepo Workflow

- This repository is a monorepo. Identify the owning service before editing.
- Most changes belong to one of: `frontend/`, `indexer/`, `dong-service/`, `socket-service/`, `prove-service/`.
- Prefer the smallest targeted change in the owning service instead of cross-service refactors.
- Do not assume a root-wide test or lint command exists.
- Run commands from the relevant service directory.

## Commands

- Root local stack: `docker compose up --build`
- Frontend: `npm install`, `npm run dev`, `npm run build`, `npm run lint`, `npm run format:check`
- Indexer: `go mod download`, `go build -o main .`, `go test ./... -v`, `golangci-lint run`, `gofmt -w .`
- Dong service: `make build`, `make run`, `make test`, `make swagger`, `golangci-lint run`, `gofmt -w .`
- Socket service: `go run main.go`, `go build ./...`, `go test ./... -v`, `golangci-lint run`, `gofmt -w .`
- Prove service: `go run main.go`, `go build ./...`, `go test ./... -v`

## Single-Test Guidance

- Prefer `go test ./path/to/package -run '^TestExactName$' -v`.
- Keep regex anchored with `^` and `$`.
- If frontend tests are requested, first confirm whether a test runner was added; none is configured by default.

## Safety

- Preserve user changes outside the task scope.
- Do not fabricate commands, CI coverage, or test runners.
- If you add a new script, command, or workflow, update `AGENTS.md` too.
